    5. Let j be the character value of character b.
    6. If i > j, throw a SyntaxError exception.
es5id: 15.10.2.15_A1_T10
description: >
    Checking if execution of "/[\10b-G]/.exec("a")" leads to throwing
    the correct exception
---*/

